:: StoryTitle
The Lantern Gate

:: Arrival {"position":"400,40","size":"180,60"}
The gate is locked. A lantern glows in the watchtower.
[[Ask the keeper for help->Ask for help]]
[[Find your own way inside->Go alone]]

:: Ask for help {"position":"170,240","size":"180,60"}
The keeper lowers her lantern. "What brings you here?"
[[Tell her about the missing courier->An ally]]
[[Offer to repair the gate->A bargain]]

:: Go alone {"position":"690,240","size":"180,60"}
Beyond the wall, you hear water moving through an old tunnel.
[[Follow the water->A new path]]

:: An ally {"position":"40,470","size":"180,60"}
"I knew the courier," she says, and hands you a brass key.

:: A bargain {"position":"320,470","size":"180,60"}
You mend the hinge. The keeper opens the gate with a smile.

:: A new path {"position":"690,470","size":"180,60"}
The tunnel leads beneath the gate. Your journey begins.
